{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1000_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "931f01603fc700267c0d43a190c516e2208bd5b5f7cd98e397fd4a7735a17054", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす！", "zh": "辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1003_p", "source_sha256": "457a881d3171ed9000ef8bfcafdd07ae17162dd6e8e926ef7d1a873b8f411938", "ja": "お疲れさま！\n3人とも、もう揃ってたんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了！\n没想到连3个人都已经到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "930ce8d9035463dac8c6e99c14ed5522b61b13a11e226aec01f3e30be4c57f71", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん。\n未来さん達とお仕事だったんだ？", "zh": "啊，哥哥。你是和未来她们一起工作的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cde952b57d4669b073c49429755c5af53e37a18aef918bbee46bf2d4dddc9e23", "ja": "いや、そこで偶然一緒になっただけだ。\n……ん？", "zh": "不是，只是碰巧在那里遇到的。\n……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1006_p", "source_sha256": "337469226a223e985a7bbe62e413621c78a186c4d341e4402db9e97b3a6bdbfc", "ja": "麗花、どうした？\nなんだかソワソワしてるみたいだけど。", "zh": "丽花，怎么了？感觉你一直坐立不安的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "871e88506258fef09b7968113cedddf1865206d9358d3b398cc2e3a280bb4fb2", "ja": "ふふ、気のせいですよ。そんなことより、\n公演のミーティングを始めちゃいましょう♪", "zh": "呵呵，是你的错觉啦。比起那个，先开始公演会议吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "df47e66d97bc7835e75cc8b341b24f8920fb0ea984ff003a164cf8e3dbe3f4d5", "ja": "そうか？　じゃあ始めるけど……\nここにいる5人が、次の定期公演のメンバーだ。", "zh": "是吗？那就开始吧……\n在场的这5人，就是下次定期公演的成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "776b543aeba367474d9c29bf37d1e6c6c1cc6ae161c9e6a6c4e0a341ae7a0526", "ja": "麗花が新曲をお披露目するという事で、\nチケットの売り上げも好調だ。", "zh": "因为丽花要展示新曲，门票的销量也很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "25b86804c918d9b396ce981623b45824a59d20ffbb4e909cc3b537cc4c494ca4", "ja": "ファンの皆の期待以上の公演ができるよう、\n頑張っていこう。よろしくな！", "zh": "为了带来超出所有粉丝期待的演出，一起努力吧。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "6c8d85c1f3f323e79b60f54e29acf465df3624110ece5f20f0b98640c4ddcde8", "ja": "はいっ、気合いをぎゅぎゅっと入れて\nたくさん頑張っちゃいますね♪", "zh": "好的，我会鼓足干劲，努力呈现一场超出大家期待的演出♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "bf600fed6b4f695159a66ae93b85e3c164499e4b74ba45ca1b92153151d6f6ca", "ja": "ところで{$P$}さん、\nチケットは用意してきてくれましたか？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生，\n你把票准备好带来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4dbc28fb2bcc82d03fe3497dea9c3354e6616d329a6ac4969a9c4e2bfe491ec5", "ja": "ああ、もらってきたぞ。\n1枚で良かったんだよな？", "zh": "啊，我已经拿来了。\n是要1张，没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "96129e858c61c7359c1baf4493db193c08564f216cd4c71f0adf23793590e23b", "ja": "わ～い、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哇～，非常感谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "da928ffed0b427a7de03b784681759956fafd2dd2152aeff6bc8319a64ba6dad", "ja": "あっ、もうこんな時間！\n大変、待ち合わせに遅れちゃう。", "zh": "啊，已经这么晚了！\n糟糕，要赶不上约定的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "a9e7c868c3c09ef486c1812a18d3776943e7b75162ea0eceb7bd1561b832aaa5", "ja": "用事があるので、お先に失礼しちゃいますね！\nではでは～♪　ふんふふ～ん♪", "zh": "我还有点事，就先走一步啦！\n那就先这样～♪ 哼哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2ca87fb1a2fb87cebeac9f92f1193bb88d60d20b6387c5ce2740f3aec5da446b", "ja": "また明日な、お疲れさま！", "zh": "明天见，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1019_se", "source_sha256": "f9ab9c0e82198616dcb11b1dff7f8fccc121e11869006855284bd811ec05903e", "ja": "ガチャ、……バタン！", "zh": "咔嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "27450fe96778d74155e8016ba5714b4c192d73aea3bb21ecc420c146bcb48099", "ja": "……なあ、{$P$}。\nレイのやつ、ここのところずっとヘンじゃないか？", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}。\n丽花那家伙，最近是不是一直怪怪的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5be1cf03f482e96cacd575ae7b6ad047da6d1046005855be020cca09cb1776fe", "ja": "ヘン？", "zh": "奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "c846fecd4256b54f0a165feae746eb754081f3397d839ed9e9f1a9c8f56ba4ff", "ja": "最近、すごいんだよ。もともとサボるやつじゃ\nないんだけど……レッスンも、やけに熱心でさ。", "zh": "最近，她状态很不一样。本来就不是那种会偷懒的人……但最近上课特别拼命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "18fb135a185610da9fa78b85bca9243efcac245d80f6a43731d5a46fae25ac68", "ja": "かと思えば、今みたいにフイッとどこかへ消えたり。\nまるで台風だ。", "zh": "可有时又会像现在这样，突然不知跑到哪里去了。简直就像台风一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1024_p", "source_sha256": "282309c99c99f4ae23d3ab3770b987549aff01667e6d4c462cad101049fc70e6", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、どことなく\nソワソワした感じがするのは気になったけど……。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，我也注意到她总有种莫名坐立不安的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8cbd9041a81b7a5fe122bd23bd33c59d72114ad9b5b8859ae9368d00afe53c05", "ja": "センターだから、やる気いっぱいなんじゃないか？", "zh": "因为是中心位，所以干劲十足吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "d86a59a063129519bef0ddfc7e58a8c0b704a7fdc756178de7d51e70ef95fedf", "ja": "でも、センターに選ばれたのは\n初めてじゃないだろ？", "zh": "不过，被选为中心位也不是第一次了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "b462a11dfe0a4804dc24bb7f33cda7465c0f2cfa3d8f9d85f880c5cd58e6ca02", "ja": "そうね。最近の麗花ちゃん、なんだか楽しそうだし。\nなんていうか、まるで……。", "zh": "是啊。最近的丽花，好像挺开心的。\n怎么说呢，简直就像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "e008b9c5779830bed7f24d18a0d4cbd4776b49723dcf6ae66acca7808e34f1b8", "ja": "もしかして……恋人ができたとか！？", "zh": "难道说……是交男朋友了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4a854818da1f296ee8d1e8ffc19ecd63150e306cbf65fa051b3e26f2cebeb40c", "ja": "えーっ！", "zh": "诶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "4a854818da1f296ee8d1e8ffc19ecd63150e306cbf65fa051b3e26f2cebeb40c", "ja": "えーっ！", "zh": "诶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "4a854818da1f296ee8d1e8ffc19ecd63150e306cbf65fa051b3e26f2cebeb40c", "ja": "えーっ！", "zh": "诶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "4a854818da1f296ee8d1e8ffc19ecd63150e306cbf65fa051b3e26f2cebeb40c", "ja": "えーっ！", "zh": "诶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "9d1aaa251ac94103dce2245f38c63bc153e764b62426c3da2c87eb69d74e7d87", "ja": "もう！　お兄ちゃんまで、\n桃子たちといっしょに驚かないでよ！", "zh": "真是的！哥哥你也别和桃子她们一起被吓到了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1034_p", "source_sha256": "fd882bec9c5c3dcef08cf5569f61bcf41302347205be9bafa64953f4c08cb254", "ja": "ハッ！？　すまない、つい……！", "zh": "哈！？抱歉，一不小心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "5b599c3ab78cd6091fa80f3b291d54d7d3bb3f092991c608762e958851448a10", "ja": "こ、恋人って、どこの誰だよ！？", "zh": "恋、恋人？哪儿来的啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "9f8efcfcf503d1fb2683353a8f04b4887b62626773d885af73fdceb32d72496b", "ja": "え？　それはわからないですけど……。\nなんとなく、そうじゃないかな～って。", "zh": "诶？这个我也不清楚……只是隐约觉得，可能是这样吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1037_052kao", "source_sha256": "5a1bd825924b16bba5b0feb38de26bb523c297dd8080b01bd6711d31bd5c66e3", "ja": "じゃあ最近の麗花ちゃんが、ソワソワしたり、\n楽しそうだったりするのって……？", "zh": "那么，最近丽花显得坐立不安、又一副很开心的样子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "63ff5b3dd67d20002225f7fafbc5644c91b708561aa7304557c10a3538ae4aed", "ja": "そういえば、お兄ちゃんに\n次の公演の招待チケットもらってたよね。", "zh": "说起来，你不是还拿到了哥哥给你的下一场公演的邀请票吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "c9a302af44af684b9d93c1f2bbb0b66be89133d6cc0e60cd19f25eec2b1d967a", "ja": "恋人に渡しにいったのかも……？", "zh": "该不会是拿去送给对象了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1040_p", "source_sha256": "dd7ed93b5f61ef190d73ed5a2a0744679113c1d0003a7e063a8686d4ff89dc02", "ja": "いや、そんなまさか……。", "zh": "不，怎么可能……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "48735c2220309740c68b67548600ec9a1da32d6cc9e8c71a22b577c7d15c03da", "ja": "でも、恋人が観に来るから張り切ってるとすれば、\n辻褄は合うよな……。", "zh": "不过，如果是因为恋人要来看，所以才干劲十足的话，倒也说得通……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "5c6fd214feb12fd7d04973277261a83e641fd543d9d60b8826367b1468c0e901", "ja": "くっ、気になって練習どころじゃないな……。\n今なら間に合う……よし、レイを追いかけよう！", "zh": "可恶，越想越在意，根本没法练习……  \n现在去追还来得及……好，去追丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "ddc4a09dce7673f2ccb1f274d84a893517eb3d0048b8a658db351fa0a762b002", "ja": "待って、桃子も行く！", "zh": "等等，桃子也要去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "adb6db465a184390bb87922697c83e441da97210144cd42fdb05134c554d3c23", "ja": "私も私も！", "zh": "我也是我也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1046_p", "source_sha256": "67321b7f068cb32ae6326a96d6f9c934bbd0665a40ed692f218879d25b776c26", "ja": "えっ！？　みんな、ちょっと……！", "zh": "诶！？大家，等一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1047_null", "source_sha256": "f9ab9c0e82198616dcb11b1dff7f8fccc121e11869006855284bd811ec05903e", "ja": "ガチャ、……バタン！", "zh": "咔嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "7e86a7c179a7cfd148ec203d4ae4f9f1cb2c9a00c4768008b75a4e936cdb43dd", "ja": "……行っちゃいましたね。\nそれにしても、麗花ちゃんに恋人……。", "zh": "……走掉了呢。\n不过真没想到，丽花居然有恋人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1049_p", "source_sha256": "115143e0e0529540ea5bd8fadfe044f429355d55aef9f537f750b536d8b32e3f", "ja": "アイドルにも、プライバシーはあります。\nだから、そっとしておくべきなんですが……。", "zh": "偶像也有隐私。\n所以，应该默默地不去打扰她才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1050_p", "source_sha256": "6677efc9f5dfec33e83c3c5cf086adb6f830cab9d56d64aa47262253b9cf1445", "ja": "ただ……今までそんな素振りを見せなかったから、\n本当なのかどうか……。", "zh": "只是……之前完全没表现出那种迹象，\n所以也不知道是不是真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1051_p", "source_sha256": "2383cd450a4b6189023cbaa0ed819d291792104aaa9f0ceb8f7a8d2c6621b693", "ja": "もしかしたら、\n悪い奴に騙されているかも……！？", "zh": "说不定，\n是被坏家伙给骗了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1052_052kao", "source_sha256": "22d144fbb52c103415032007e9d7ecaee6a37c17c5672a1a6df2df324cc88e18", "ja": "{$P$}さん。この場はひとまず、\n3人の保護者として、みんなを追いかけませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。现在先让我们以\n3人监护人的身份，去追大家吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1053_052kao", "source_sha256": "4b10ab721c507d75f3425474eab848d4347d3fab8e774c23f8ca1b8c1faa652e", "ja": "麗花ちゃんはもちろんですけど……\nみんなのことも、心配ですから。", "zh": "丽花当然不用说……不过，我也很担心大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_104_1054_p", "source_sha256": "a1e7651fc1515d0ff0d644d5bb4806d3ee6ea9dabb572922029028d865e78eeb", "ja": "そうですね……ありがとうございます、歌織さん。\nみんなを、追いかけましょう！", "zh": "是啊……谢谢你，歌织。\n我们去追上大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
